  "cues": [
   [
    0.104,
    "Zoom into a drop of water."
   ],
   [
    1.914,
    "Each molecule has a slightly negative oxygen end, and slightly positive hydrogen ends."
   ],
   [
    7.617,
    "So a hydrogen on one molecule is drawn toward the oxygen of its neighbor."
   ],
   [
    12.63,
    "One bond is weak."
   ],
   [
    14.01,
    "It breaks and re-forms in a fraction of a second."
   ],
   [
    17.552,
    "But each molecule has several neighbors, so together the bonds hold the liquid as one body."
   ],
   [
    23.438,
    "Water molecules sticking to each other like this is called cohesion."
   ]
  ]
 },
